From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the Settings app ranks cameras and microphones

The Settings app picks the camera and microphone a site gets when it
names none. Chrome keeps that choice as a ranking in the profile's
prefs, and //chrome/browser/media/prefs reads and writes it.

Its visibility lists the targets that may use it. The fork's command
socket in //chrome/browser/domicile is added.
---
 chrome/browser/media/prefs/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/media/prefs/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/media/prefs/BUILD.gn
index c5f0aaa..a621661 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/media/prefs/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/media/prefs/BUILD.gn
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ source_set("prefs") {
     "//chrome/browser",
     "//chrome/browser:core",
     "//chrome/browser:core_unit_tests",
+    "//chrome/browser/domicile:*",
     "//chrome/browser/media/webrtc:*",
     "//chrome/browser/prefs:impl",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/views/media_preview/*",
